          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP781 - Golden Spike Rd&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to the earlier finders the cap was ready for the money shot. It was pretty quiet this morning when we arrived as we found good parking and captured a few pictures of this part of town - thanks OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
